{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1312","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E. Array Shrinking"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given an array $$$a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n$$$. You can perform the following operation any number of times:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Choose a pair of two neighboring equal elements $$$a_i = a_{i + 1}$$$ (if there is at least one such pair). "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Replace them by one element with value $$$a_i + 1$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After each such operation, the length of the array will decrease by one (and elements are renumerated accordingly). What is the minimum possible length of the array $$$a$$$ you can get?"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains the single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 500$$$) — the initial length of the array $$$a$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n$$$ ($$$1 \\le a_i \\le 1000$$$) — the initial array $$$a$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print the only integer — the minimum possible length you can get after performing the operation described above any number of times."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n4 3 2 2 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n7\n3 3 4 4 4 3 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n1 3 5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1\n1000\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test, this is one of the optimal sequences of operations: $$$4$$$ $$$3$$$ $$$2$$$ $$$2$$$ $$$3$$$ $$$\\rightarrow$$$ $$$4$$$ $$$3$$$ $$$3$$$ $$$3$$$ $$$\\rightarrow$$$ $$$4$$$ $$$4$$$ $$$3$$$ $$$\\rightarrow$$$ $$$5$$$ $$$3$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second test, this is one of the optimal sequences of operations: $$$3$$$ $$$3$$$ $$$4$$$ $$$4$$$ $$$4$$$ $$$3$$$ $$$3$$$ $$$\\rightarrow$$$ $$$4$$$ $$$4$$$ $$$4$$$ $$$4$$$ $$$3$$$ $$$3$$$ $$$\\rightarrow$$$ $$$4$$$ $$$4$$$ $$$4$$$ $$$4$$$ $$$4$$$ $$$\\rightarrow$$$ $$$5$$$ $$$4$$$ $$$4$$$ $$$4$$$ $$$\\rightarrow$$$ $$$5$$$ $$$5$$$ $$$4$$$ $$$\\rightarrow$$$ $$$6$$$ $$$4$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third and fourth tests, you can't perform the operation at all."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"E","problemCode":"1312E","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1312/problem/E"}